'''White Swordsman Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a [[Daily Bonus|Stamp Reward]] during the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 434
|rarity = EX
|name1 = White Swordsman Cat
|name2 = Black Swordsman Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Black Swordsman Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This Cat has resistance against [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Zombies]]. At level 30, White Swordsman Cat has 23,800 health against Zombies along with the cost and recharge time of a Tank Cat. This makes him a usable extra line of defense for most Zombie stages, as against Zombies with his recharge time, is able to provide almost an extra Eraser's level of defense against them.

[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu Cat]] can do much the same as this unit with Research Up [[Cat Combo]]s like [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]], makes for a more ideal anti-Zombie meatshield due to the higher health, but be wary of the more than doubled cost of this unit and a higher recharge time, leaving this unit better for Zombie stages with higher money, or using them both.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

